rwise: `char_begin` = byte-to-char of the section's `text_range().start()`\n- `char_end` = byte-to-char of the section's `text_range().end()`\n\n### FILE property in jsonl2org\n\nOnly inject `:FILE:` property when entries reference more than one distinct source file. The check is:\n```rust\nlet distinct_files: HashSet<&str> = entries.iter().filter_map(|e| e.file.as_deref()).collect();\nlet inject = distinct_files.len() > 1;\n```\n\nWhen injecting, insert `Property { key: \"FILE\", value: file_path }` at position 0 of the heading's `properties` vec. This ensures it appears first in the `:PROPERTIES:` drawer. Headings that had no property drawer will gain one.\n\nSection entries (zeroth section) do not get a FILE property since they lack property drawers.\n",
